PocketSmart AI 💰

Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

PocketSmart AI is a simple web-based budget assistant designed to help users manage their monthly income, expenses, and savings.

Features

- 💰 Monthly income input
- 📊 Monthly expense calculation
- 💵 Estimated savings calculation
- 🤖 Smart budget recommendation
- 📱 Simple and user-friendly interface
- 🌐 Responsive web design

Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

How It Works

1. Enter your monthly income.
2. Enter your monthly expenses.
3. Click the Calculate button.
4. PocketSmart AI calculates your estimated savings.
5. Click Get Recommendation to receive a budgeting suggestion.

Project Files

- "index.html" – Main webpage
- "style.css" – Website design and styling
- "script.js" – Website functionality
- "README.md" – Project information

Project Objective

The main objective of PocketSmart AI is to provide a simple digital solution for managing personal budgets and encouraging better saving habits.

